    "effect": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Effect",
      "value": "You open a gate to a different age, long enough for a small group of people to pass through. These gates can only be opened at certain locations, where influential historical events have left their mark all the way to the present, and only during certain stellar constellations. For example, to travel back to a famous battle, you would first have to determine its location, then open a gate at the spot. A successful skill check is required to pinpoint the exact point in time you wish to travel to. It’s easy to end up days or even years off the mark if you traverse the centuries. Be careful with changing the past, as the present you return to may end up very different from the place you (and only you) remember."
    },
